        {
            "+content": "A romantic fantasy comic by Wamome Hamazono. Trivia the princess of the Moon Kingdom meets a mysterious boy named Licht during a festival and promises to travel the world with him when they grow up. Eight years later just as she prepares to set off her homeland is suddenly attacked and destroyed by a neighboring nation. Worse yet the leader of the invasion is Licht the very boy she yearned to see again. A compelling tale of revenge fate and tragic romance.",
